Subject: [PATCH 2/3] winemac: Factor out Metal device and view logic into
 MetalViewSwapChain.

---
 dlls/winemac.drv/cocoa_window.m | 68 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/winemac.drv/macdrv.h       |  8 ++--
